<title>UK: Cable &amp; Wireless gains as BZW rates &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Cable &amp; Wireless gains as BZW rates &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cable &amp; Wireless Plc rose on Thursday as analysts at BZW issued a &quot;buy&quot; rating on the stock and raised their valuation of the telecom group's assets outside Hong Kong, market sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 9-1/2p at 458-1/2 by 1224 GMT, after rising as high as 460p -- its highest since May 23. Volume was an active 4.02 million shares.  </p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediatly available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
